{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Tree — {{ project.title }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}

<h1>Project tree</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Every item in the project, filed by the containment spine: workspace,
  board, <code>part_of</code> group, item. An item is expanded once, under
  <strong>its own board</strong> — inside a node for its first group by id
  when a group fits, or directly when it has none — and listed as a
  reference under every other group. A group node may appear in more than
  one board branch, each showing only that board's members; the group
  itself expands once, under its own board or under
  <strong>Project-wide</strong>. Items with no board keep the same rule
  (first group by id, else Project-wide, rendered last). Nothing here is
  hidden: the counts are the whole project, and no item is ever absent
  from its own board.
</p>

{{ tree_html | safe }}

{% endblock %}
